---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Gutter Guards in Woodbridge, VA | Leaf Protection" description="Install micro-mesh and screen gutter guards in Woodbridge, VA. Reduce cleaning frequency and keep debris out. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Gutter Guards</div>
      <h1>Gutter Guards in Woodbridge, VA</h1>
      <p>Keep leaves and debris out year-round with micro-mesh or screen systems designed for Northern Virginia trees.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Benefits of Gutter Protection</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dramatically fewer cleanings</li>
        <li>Reduced risk of clogs and overflows</li>
        <li>Protection from needles and small debris</li>
        <li>Options that still allow water flow in heavy rain</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We install proven micro-mesh and screen products suited to the leaf load in Woodbridge neighborhoods. Guards work best on sound, properly pitched gutters — we inspect first and recommend any needed repairs.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay} About Guards</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
